# Copy to .env (gitignored, chmod 600) and fill in real values.
#
# EDUROAM_*           read by modules/core/network.nix; substituted into the
#                     NetworkManager eduroam profile at activation time, so a
#                     missing or empty value shows up as a failed wifi auth.
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY  read by aider-chat.
#
# Parsed by systemd (EnvironmentFile=), so: KEY=value, no `export`, no quotes
# unless the value genuinely contains them.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=your-openrouter-key-here
EDUROAM_IDENTITY=your-institutional-login@example.edu
EDUROAM_ANON_IDENTITY=anonymous@example.edu
EDUROAM_PASSWORD=your-eduroam-password-here
